{"id":"nc9628bd4d1","headline":"Turks often keep gold as a hedge against inflation. It may be hurting Turkey's future","summary":"Billions of dollars of gold are held by Turkish households outside the banking system. The government aims to persuade citizens to move it into mainstream finance to help the economy.","why":"Gold hoarding outside banks limits the funding available to the banking system and the central bank's reserves. Turkey has long faced inflation pressures that drive households toward gold.","category":"economy","event_type":"capital","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Ankara","country":"Turkey","lat":39.93,"lon":32.86,"region":"eu"},"entities":[{"name":"Gold","ticker":"GC=F","kind":"company","sym":"XAU","asset":{"id":"CM:XAU","n":"Gold","c":"commodity","px":"GC=F","la":51.51,"lo":-0.09,"geo":"markets","site":"XAU","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"WUTC","url":"https://www.wutc.org/2026-09-15/turks-often-keep-gold-as-a-hedge-against-inflation-it-may-be-hurting-turkeys-future"},"sources":[{"name":"WUTC","url":"https://www.wutc.org/2026-09-15/turks-often-keep-gold-as-a-hedge-against-inflation-it-may-be-hurting-turkeys-future"}],"published_at":"2026-09-15T18:26:14Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"2ccec1a5491bc67d","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-15T18:26:14Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-16T03:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"TU","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/gold-bars-163553.jpg","alt":"gold bars (illustration)","credit":"PublicDomainPictures","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay